#: ../../reference/manifest.rst:325
msgid ""
"Note that most boards do not have their own ``manifest.py``, rather they use"
" the port one directly, in which case your manifest should just "
"``include(\"$(PORT_DIR)/boards/manifest.py\")`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Notez que la plupart des cartes n'ont pas leur propre ``manifest.py`` ; "
"elles utilisent plutôt directement celui du port, auquel cas votre manifest "
"devrait simplement faire ``include(\"$(PORT_DIR)/boards/manifest.py\")`` à "
"la place."
